  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tw93/Mole/zipball/V1.69.0",
  "body": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.tw93.fun/pic/cole.png\" alt=\"Mole Logo\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" style=\"border-radius:50%\" />\n  <h1 style=\"margin: 12px 0 6px;\">Mole</h1>\n  <p><em>Deep clean and optimize your Mac.</em></p>\n</div>\n\n### Changelog\n\n1. Snapshots from other backup apps: Synology Active Backup, Carbon Copy Cloner and similar tools leave APFS snapshots that keep deleted files using space, and `mo clean` now lists them with their owner even on a Mac without Time Machine, while `mo analyze` counts every local snapshot.\n2. Correct app names in uninstall: A hidden `.app` backup no longer shows up in `mo uninstall` under its file name with a leading dot, so the list reads the same whether or not Spotlight indexes the folder.\n3. Sizes at a unit boundary: `mo analyze` shows a file of 999,999 bytes as 1.0 MB, matching Finder, instead of 1000.0 kB.\n4. README in more languages: A Polish copy joins the others, and every README now documents the Linux install command and the timeout tuning variables.\n\n### 更新日志\n\n1. 识别其他备份软件的快照：群晖 Active Backup、Carbon Copy Cloner 这类工具留下的 APFS 快照会让删掉的文件继续占着空间，没开 Time Machine 的 Mac 上 `mo clean` 现在也会列出它们和来源，`mo analyze` 也会统计所有本地快照。\n2. 卸载列表的应用名正确：隐藏的 `.app` 备份在 `mo uninstall` 里不再显示成带点的文件名，Spotlight 有没有索引这个目录，列表都一样。\n3. 单位边界上的大小：`mo analyze` 把 999,999 字节显示成 1.0 MB，和访达一致，不再显示 1000.0 kB。\n4. README 更完整：新增波兰语版本，各语言 README 也补上了 Linux 安装命令和超时调节变量的说明。\n\n### Thanks\n\nIssue reporters and PR contributors this cycle: @chengkangzai · @carlwangx · @kevin9327 · @dkoryto · @jampueroc.\n\n### Mole Mac App\n\nIf you would rather work in a window than a terminal, [Mole Mac App](https://mole.fit/) covers cleaning, app removal, maintenance, disk analysis and live status, shows everything before it deletes, and adds tools in the menu bar. It costs $19 once, with free updates and a 14-day refund, and you can [download it here](https://mole.fit/download). The CLI stays free and open source.\n\n",
